Debian packaging notes
======================

Firmware
--------

This package ships no tuner firmware. The administrator has to install it.

The @PROFILE@ profile needs one of: @FIRMWARE_LIST@

Place the file in /lib/firmware/ and reload the module, or replug the device.
A compressed copy (.fw.xz or .fw.zst) works too on kernels built with firmware
decompression, which is the Debian default.

@FIRMWARE_NOTE@

Modules this package installs
-----------------------------

DKMS installs into /lib/modules/<kernel>/updates/dkms/:
@MODULE_LIST@

Not all of these exist in a stock kernel. Where one does, DKMS moves the
in-tree file aside into /var/lib/dkms/@MODULE@/original_module/ and puts this
build in its place, so the out-of-tree version then serves *all* devices that
use that module, not only this tuner. Removing the package puts the original
back. On a host with other DVB hardware, check that those devices still work
after installing this package.

Profiles that build the same modules
------------------------------------

Some tuner profiles produce the same module names. t230 and t210 both build
dvb_usb_v2, dvb-usb-dvbsky, si2168 and si2157, so their packages would install
the same files. Do not install two such packages on one machine; there is no
Conflicts declaration that would stop you.

Secure Boot
-----------

DKMS signs the modules with a key it generates itself, by default
/var/lib/dkms/mok.key with the certificate in /var/lib/dkms/mok.pub. That
signature only counts once the certificate is enrolled in the firmware:

    sudo mokutil --import /var/lib/dkms/mok.pub

and confirm the enrolment during the next boot. Until then a Secure Boot
machine refuses to load the modules and the tuner stays absent, even though
"dkms status" reports success. Turning Secure Boot off works too.

Source
------

The driver sources are a reduced copy of https://github.com/tbsdtv/linux_media
plus the patch series carried by this project. The exact commit and patch list
used for this build are recorded in
/usr/src/@MODULE@-@VERSION@/PROVENANCE.
